#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: mixmymeals.php includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1343
#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1344
msgid "MixMyMeals"
msgstr "MixMyMeals"

#. Description of the plugin
#: mixmymeals.php
msgid ""
"Build recipes, plan weekly meals and generate shopping lists — with a "
"frontend planner and nutrition data."
msgstr ""
"Rezepte anlegen, Wochenpläne erstellen und Einkaufslisten erzeugen — mit "
"Planer im Frontend und Nährwerten."

#. Author of the plugin
#: mixmymeals.php
msgid "Timo Fricke"
msgstr "Timo Fricke"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:254
msgid "General"
msgstr "Allgemein"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:255
msgid ""
"Currency, placeholder image, scheduled cleanup and what happens on "
"uninstall. Recipes, ingredients, meal plans, visitors and e-mail each have "
"their own tab."
msgstr ""
"Währung, Platzhalterbild, das geplante Aufräumen und was beim Deinstallieren"
" geschieht. Rezepte, Zutaten, Essenspläne, Besucher und E-Mail haben je "
"einen eigenen Tab."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:261
msgid "Display"
msgstr "Anzeige"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:265
msgid "Currency"
msgstr "Währung"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:266
msgid "Currency symbol used for price display."
msgstr "Währungssymbol für die Preisanzeige."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:273
msgid "Placeholder Image"
msgstr "Platzhalterbild"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:274
msgid ""
"Used only as a fallback for social link previews and Instagram slide "
"backgrounds. On the website, recipes without a photo are shown cookbook-"
"style with their title only."
msgstr ""
"Wird nur noch als Fallback für Social-Link-Vorschauen und Instagram-"
"Hintergründe verwendet. Auf der Website erscheinen Rezepte ohne Foto im "
"Kochbuch-Stil nur mit ihrem Titel."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:286
msgid "Cleanup"
msgstr "Aufräumen"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:290
msgid "Enable Cleanup"
msgstr "Aufräumen aktivieren"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:291
msgid ""
"Automatically delete orphaned meals and old meal plans without a category "
"once per day."
msgstr ""
"Verwaiste Mahlzeiten und alte Mahlzeitenpläne ohne Kategorie einmal täglich "
"automatisch löschen."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:302
msgid "Cleanup Minimum Age"
msgstr "Mindestalter für das Aufräumen"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:303
msgid "Only delete items older than this many days."
msgstr "Nur Einträge löschen, die älter als diese Anzahl Tage sind."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:314
msgid "Cleanup Report"
msgstr "Aufräum-Bericht"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:315
msgid ""
"E-mail a summary after each cleanup run, including deletions made by the "
"mail log, the Instagram image cleanup and the subscription retention (only "
"when something was deleted)."
msgstr ""
"Nach jedem Aufräumlauf eine Zusammenfassung per E-Mail senden, inklusive der"
" Löschungen aus Sendeprotokoll, Instagram-Bildaufräumung und Abo-"
"Aufbewahrung (nur wenn etwas gelöscht wurde)."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:326
msgid "Report Recipient"
msgstr "Berichtsempfänger"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:327
msgid ""
"Address the cleanup report is sent to. Leave empty to use the site admin "
"e-mail."
msgstr ""
"Adresse, an die der Aufräum-Bericht gesendet wird. Leer lassen, um die "
"Admin-E-Mail der Seite zu verwenden.Adresse, an die der Aufräum-Bericht "
"gesendet wird. Leer lassen, um die Admin-E-Mail der Seite zu verwenden."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:339
msgid "Privacy"
msgstr "Datenschutz"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:343
msgid "Delete data on uninstall"
msgstr "Daten bei Deinstallation löschen"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:344
msgid ""
"When the plugin is deleted, also remove personal data (newsletter "
"subscriptions, ratings and visitor photos). Recipes and plans are always "
"kept. Off by default so an accidental deletion does not destroy records."
msgstr ""
"Beim Löschen des Plugins auch personenbezogene Daten entfernen (Newsletter-"
"Abos, Bewertungen und Besucherfotos). Rezepte und Pläne bleiben immer "
"erhalten. Standardmäßig aus, damit ein versehentliches Löschen keine "
"Datensätze zerstört."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:353
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-post-types.php:917
msgid "Recipes"
msgstr "Rezepte"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:354
msgid ""
"Everything listed under Recipes in the menu: recipe addresses and archive, "
"the cooking steps, authors and equipment."
msgstr ""
"Alles, was im Menü unter Rezepte steht: Adressen und Archiv der Rezepte, die"
" Zubereitungsschritte, Autoren und Küchengeräte."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:360
#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:516
#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:558
msgid "URL Slugs"
msgstr "URL-Slugs"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:364
msgid "Recipe Slug"
msgstr "Rezept-Slug"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:365
msgid "Set the prefix for recipes in the URL."
msgstr "Setze das Präfix für Rezepte in der URL."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:376
msgid "Recipe Category Slug"
msgstr "Kategorie-Slug"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:377
msgid "Set the prefix for recipe categories in the URL."
msgstr "Setze das Präfix für Kategorien in der URL."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:388
msgid "Author Slug"
msgstr "Autoren-Slug"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:389
msgid ""
"Set the prefix for author archives in the URL. Must not be \"author\" — "
"WordPress uses that for its own user archives. Authors currently have no "
"public pages, so this takes effect only once they do."
msgstr ""
"Legt das Präfix für Autorenarchive in der URL fest. Darf nicht \"author\" "
"sein — das nutzt WordPress für seine eigenen Benutzerarchive. Autoren haben "
"derzeit keine öffentlichen Seiten; die Einstellung wirkt erst, wenn sie "
"welche bekommen."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:400
msgid "Equipment Slug"
msgstr "Küchengeräte-Slug"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:401
msgid ""
"Set the prefix for equipment in the URL. Changing it flushes the permalinks."
msgstr ""
"Legt das Präfix für Küchengeräte in der URL fest. Eine Änderung erneuert die"
" Permalinks."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:413
msgid "Archive & Display"
msgstr "Archiv & Anzeige"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:417
msgid "Recipe Disclaimer"
msgstr "Rezept-Disclaimer"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:418
msgid "Write a disclaimer for your recipes."
msgstr "Schreibe einen Disclaimer für deine Rezepte."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:429
msgid "Recipe Archive Description"
msgstr "Rezeptarchivbeschreibung"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:430
#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:489
#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:538
#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:645
#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:657
msgid "This description will be used by the corresponding shortcode."
msgstr "Diese Beschreibung wird vom zugehörigen Shortcode genutzt."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:442
msgid "Cooking Steps"
msgstr "Zubereitungsschritte"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:446
msgid "Steps on Recipe Pages"
msgstr "Schritte auf Rezeptseiten"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:447
msgid ""
"Show the cooking steps on the recipe page. When switched off, only the note "
"below is shown there and the steps remain available on the meal pages."
msgstr ""
"Zeigt die Zubereitungsschritte auf der Rezeptseite. Ist die Option aus, "
"erscheint dort nur der Hinweis unten; die Schritte bleiben auf den "
"Mahlzeitenseiten verfügbar."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:458
msgid "Note Instead of Steps"
msgstr "Hinweis statt Schritte"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:459
msgid ""
"Shown on the recipe page in place of the steps while “Steps on Recipe Pages”"
" is switched off. Leave empty to output nothing at all."
msgstr ""
"Wird auf der Rezeptseite anstelle der Schritte angezeigt, solange „Schritte "
"auf Rezeptseiten“ ausgeschaltet ist. Leer lassen, um gar nichts auszugeben."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:471
msgid "Ratings"
msgstr "Bewertungen"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:475
msgid "Rating / review notice"
msgstr "Hinweis bei Bewertung/Rezension"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:476
msgid ""
"Shown on the rating and review form on recipe pages (e.g. a note that "
"reviews are moderated). Leave empty to hide."
msgstr ""
"Erscheint im Bewertungs- und Rezensionsformular auf Rezeptseiten (z.B. "
"Hinweis, dass Rezensionen moderiert werden). Leer lassen zum Ausblenden."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:484
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-post-types.php:771
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-post-types.php:772
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-post-types.php:775
msgid "Equipment"
msgstr "Küchengeräte"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:488
msgid "Equipment Archive Description"
msgstr "Archivbeschreibung für Küchengeräte"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:500
msgid "Affiliate disclosure"
msgstr "Werbekennzeichnung"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:501
msgid ""
"Shown below the shop links on equipment pages. Affiliate links must be "
"labelled as advertising; leave empty to use the built-in wording."
msgstr ""
"Erscheint unter den Shop-Links auf Geräteseiten. Affiliate-Links müssen als "
"Werbung gekennzeichnet werden; leer lassen nutzt den eingebauten Text."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:510
msgid "Ingredients"
msgstr "Zutaten"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:511
msgid "Ingredient URL slug and archive display."
msgstr "URL-Slug und Archivanzeige für Zutaten."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:520
msgid "Ingredient Slug"
msgstr "Zutaten-Slug"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:521
msgid "Set the prefix for ingredients in the URL."
msgstr "Lege das Präfix für Zutaten in der URL fest."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:533
msgid "Archive"
msgstr "Archiv"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:537
msgid "Ingredient Archive Description"
msgstr "Archivbeschreibung für Zutaten"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:551
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-post-types.php:557
msgid "Meal Plans"
msgstr "Essenspläne"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:552
msgid ""
"Plan and meal addresses, the planner visitors build their own plans in, and "
"what a plan page shows."
msgstr ""
"Adressen der Pläne und Mahlzeiten, der Planer, in dem Besucher eigene Pläne "
"zusammenstellen, und was eine Planseite zeigt."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:562
msgid "Meal Plan Slug"
msgstr "Essensplan-Slug"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:563
msgid "Set the prefix for meal plans in the URL."
msgstr "Setze das Präfix für Essenspläne in der URL."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:574
msgid "Meal Plan Category Slug"
msgstr "Essensplan Kategorie-Slug"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:575
msgid "Set the prefix for meal plan categories in the URL."
msgstr "Setze das Präfix für Essensplankategorien in der URL."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:586
msgid "Meal Slug"
msgstr "Mahlzeit-Slug"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:587
msgid "Set the prefix for meals in the URL."
msgstr "Setze das Präfix für Mahlzeiten in der URL."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:599
msgid "Planner"
msgstr "Planer"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:603
msgid "Max. meals in planner"
msgstr "Max. Mahlzeiten im Planer"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:604
msgid "How many meals should be allowed in the planner?"
msgstr "Wie viele Mahlzeiten sollen im Planer erlaubt sein?"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:615
msgid "Plans offered as templates"
msgstr "Als Vorlage angebotene Pläne"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:616
msgid ""
"Only offer plans that have a category. Plans a visitor built carry none, so "
"this keeps them out."
msgstr ""
"Nur Pläne mit Kategorie anbieten. Pläne, die ein Besucher gebaut hat, haben "
"keine — so bleiben sie draußen."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:627
msgid "Individual Tab Label"
msgstr "Bezeichnung für den Individuell-Tab"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:628
msgid "Label for the \"Individual\" tab in the meal plan switcher."
msgstr "Bezeichnung für den „Individuell“-Tab im Essensplan-Umschalter."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:631
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-shortcodes.php:8115
msgid "Individual"
msgstr "Individuell"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:640
msgid "Archive Descriptions"
msgstr "Archiv-Beschreibungen"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:644
msgid "Meal Plan Archive Description"
msgstr "Archivbeschreibung für Essenspläne"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:656
msgid "Individual Meal Plans Description"
msgstr "Beschreibung für individuelle Essenspläne"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:669
msgid "Plan Page"
msgstr "Planseite"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:673
msgid "Meals Without a Day"
msgstr "Mahlzeiten ohne Tag"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:674
msgid ""
"Show meals that have no weekday assigned in a group of their own, below the "
"days. Without this they appear nowhere on the plan page, although they still"
" count towards the shopping list and the nutrition figures."
msgstr ""
"Mahlzeiten ohne zugeordneten Wochentag in einer eigenen Gruppe unterhalb der"
" Tage zeigen. Ohne diese Option tauchen sie auf der Planseite nirgends auf, "
"zählen aber weiterhin in Einkaufsliste und Nährwerten mit."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:685
msgid "Heading for Those Meals"
msgstr "Überschrift dieser Gruppe"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:686
msgid "What that group is called. Leave empty for the default."
msgstr "Wie diese Gruppe heißt. Leer lassen für den Standard."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:689
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-meal-plan.php:655
msgid "No fixed day"
msgstr "Ohne festen Tag"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:698
msgid "Recipe Thumbnails"
msgstr "Rezeptbilder"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:702
msgid "Thumbnail Selection"
msgstr "Bildauswahl"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:703
msgid ""
"Which recipe pictures the thumbnail strip of a meal plan shows. Only recipes"
" with a featured image are used, and no recipe appears twice."
msgstr ""
"Welche Rezeptbilder die Bildleiste eines Ernährungsplans zeigt. Verwendet "
"werden nur Rezepte mit Beitragsbild, und kein Rezept erscheint doppelt."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:714
msgid "Max. Thumbnails"
msgstr "Max. Bilder"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:715
msgid "How many pictures the strip shows at most. 0 shows all of them."
msgstr "Wie viele Bilder die Leiste höchstens zeigt. 0 zeigt alle."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:727
msgid "Plans built by visitors"
msgstr "Pläne von Besuchern"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:731
msgid "Public Mode"
msgstr "Öffentlicher Modus"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:732
msgid "Allow every visitor to publish plans."
msgstr "Erlaube jedem jedem Besucher, Pläne zu veröffentlichen."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:742
msgid "Meal Plans per Hour"
msgstr "Pläne pro Stunde"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:743
msgid "How many plans should a visitor be allowed to publish per hour?"
msgstr "Wie viele Pläne soll ein Besucher pro Stunde veröffentlichen dürfen?"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:753
msgid "Set visitor plans to draft"
msgstr "Setze Besucherpläne auf Entwurf"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:754
msgid "Save visitor plans as drafts."
msgstr "Pläne von Besuchern als Entwürfe speichern."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:764
msgid "Success Page"
msgstr "Erfolgsseite"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:765
msgid ""
"Where to send visitors after their new plan has been published. The plan's "
"ID is appended as ?mmm_plan=, so the page can link to it. Leave unset to "
"open the plan itself."
msgstr ""
"Wohin Besucher nach dem Veröffentlichen ihres neuen Plans geleitet werden. "
"Die ID des Plans hängt als ?mmm_plan= an, damit die Seite darauf verlinken "
"kann. Nicht gesetzt: der Plan selbst."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:768
msgid "— The new plan —"
msgstr "— Der neue Plan —"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:776
msgid "Alternative Redirect"
msgstr "Alternative Umleitung"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:777
msgid "Where to send visitors after their new plan has been saved as a draft."
msgstr ""
"Wohin Besucher geleitet werden, nachdem ihr neuer Plan als Entwurf "
"gespeichert wurde."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:787
msgid "Plan creation notice"
msgstr "Hinweis bei Plan-Erstellung"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:788
msgid ""
"Shown next to the “Save Plan” button (visitor plan creation). Leave empty to"
" hide."
msgstr ""
"Erscheint neben dem „Plan speichern“-Button (Plan-Erstellung durch "
"Besucher). Leer lassen zum Ausblenden."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:796
msgid "Subscribe while saving"
msgstr "Beim Speichern abonnieren"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:800
msgid "Subscription when saving"
msgstr "Abo beim Speichern"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:801
msgid ""
"Puts an e-mail field beside the Save Plan button. “Possible”: the plan saves"
" with or without an address. “Required”: the plan only saves with one — note"
" that consent made a condition of saving can count as not freely given under"
" GDPR Art. 7(4). Double opt-in applies either way. Has no effect while "
"subscriptions are off or have no sending rule (E-Mail & Subscriptions tab)."
msgstr ""
"Setzt ein E-Mail-Feld neben den Button „Plan speichern“. „Möglich“: Der Plan"
" wird mit oder ohne Adresse gespeichert. „Pflicht“: Der Plan wird nur mit "
"Adresse gespeichert — Hinweis: Eine Einwilligung, an die das Speichern "
"geknüpft ist, kann nach Art. 7 Abs. 4 DSGVO als nicht freiwillig gelten. "
"Double-Opt-in gilt in beiden Fällen. Ohne Wirkung, solange Abos aus sind "
"oder keine Sende-Regel haben (Reiter E-Mail & Abos)."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:811
msgid "Notice text"
msgstr "Hinweistext"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:812
msgid ""
"Shown under the e-mail field. Links are allowed (<a href=\"…\">). Leave "
"empty for the standard consent sentence, which links the privacy page set in"
" the E-Mail & Subscriptions tab."
msgstr ""
"Steht unter dem E-Mail-Feld. Links sind erlaubt (<a href=\"…\">). Leer "
"lassen für den Standard-Einwilligungssatz, der auf die Datenschutzseite aus "
"dem Reiter E-Mail & Abos verlinkt."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:822
msgid "Notice as checkbox"
msgstr "Hinweis als Checkbox"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:823
msgid ""
"Show the notice as a checkbox that must be ticked whenever an address is "
"entered. Unticked, it is a plain note and entering the address is consent "
"enough."
msgstr ""
"Den Hinweis als Checkbox zeigen, die angehakt sein muss, sobald eine Adresse"
" eingetragen ist. Ohne Haken hier ist er ein reiner Hinweistext, und die "
"eingetragene Adresse genügt."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:834
msgid "Meal photos"
msgstr "Mahlzeiten-Fotos"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:838
msgid "Auto-Approve Meal Photos"
msgstr "Mahlzeiten-Fotos automatisch freigeben"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:839
msgid ""
"Publish uploaded meal photos immediately, without an admin approving them "
"first."
msgstr ""
"Hochgeladene Mahlzeiten-Fotos sofort veröffentlichen, ohne vorherige "
"Freigabe durch einen Admin."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:849
msgid "Photo upload notice"
msgstr "Hinweis beim Foto-Upload"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:850
msgid ""
"Shown on the meal-photo upload form (e.g. that you grant usage rights and "
"photos are reviewed). Leave empty to hide."
msgstr ""
"Erscheint im Foto-Upload-Formular (z.B. dass du Nutzungsrechte einräumst und"
" Fotos geprüft werden). Leer lassen zum Ausblenden."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:868
msgid "E-Mail & Subscriptions"
msgstr "E-Mail & Abos"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:869
msgid ""
"Who the plugin's e-mails come from, the meal-plan subscriptions they deliver"
" (double opt-in) and how long their data is kept."
msgstr ""
"Von wem die Mails des Plugins kommen, die Essensplan-Abos, die sie zustellen"
" (Double Opt-in), und wie lange deren Daten aufbewahrt werden."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:875
msgid "Sender Identity"
msgstr "Absender-Identität"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:879
msgid "Sender Name"
msgstr "Absendername"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:880
msgid "Name shown as the e-mail sender. Defaults to the site title."
msgstr "Name, der als Absender angezeigt wird. Standard ist der Seitentitel."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:888
msgid "Sender Address"
msgstr "Absenderadresse"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:889
msgid ""
"From address for outgoing e-mails. Leave empty to use no-reply@your-domain."
msgstr ""
"Absenderadresse für ausgehende E-Mails. Leer lassen, um no-reply@deine-"
"domain zu verwenden.Absenderadresse für ausgehende E-Mails. Leer lassen, um "
"no-reply@deine-domain zu verwenden."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:901
msgid "Activation"
msgstr "Aktivierung"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:905
msgid "Enable Subscriptions"
msgstr "Abos aktivieren"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:906
msgid ""
"Allow visitors to subscribe to meal plans and run the sending schedule."
msgstr ""
"Besuchern erlauben, Essenspläne zu abonnieren, und den Versandzeitplan "
"ausführen."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:914
msgid "Sending Rules"
msgstr "Versandregeln"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:915
msgid ""
"Each rule combines a trigger (when to send), a subject and an e-mail "
"template. Triggers are relative to the subscribed plan; templates share the "
"same placeholders (e.g. {{ greeting }}, {{ plan_url }}, {{ meal_list_html "
"}}, {{ shopping_list_html }})."
msgstr ""
"Jede Regel kombiniert einen Auslöser (wann gesendet wird), einen Betreff und"
" ein E-Mail-Template. Auslöser beziehen sich auf den abonnierten Plan; "
"Templates teilen sich dieselben Platzhalter (z.B. {{ greeting }}, {{ "
"plan_url }}, {{ meal_list_html }}, {{ shopping_list_html }})."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:922
msgid "Subscription notice"
msgstr "Hinweis beim Abonnieren"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:923
msgid ""
"Shown on the meal-plan subscription form, below the consent checkbox. Leave "
"empty to hide."
msgstr ""
"Erscheint im Abo-Formular unter der Einwilligungs-Checkbox. Leer lassen zum "
"Ausblenden."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:931
msgid "Pages & Redirects"
msgstr "Seiten & Weiterleitungen"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:935
msgid "Privacy Policy URL"
msgstr "URL der Datenschutzerklärung"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:936
msgid "Linked from the consent checkbox on the subscribe form."
msgstr "Wird von der Einwilligungs-Checkbox im Anmeldeformular verlinkt."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:944
msgid "Redirect After Subscribing"
msgstr "Weiterleitung nach Anmeldung"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:945
msgid ""
"Page to redirect to after the subscribe form is submitted. Leave empty to "
"show an inline confirmation message instead."
msgstr ""
"Seite, zu der nach dem Absenden des Anmeldeformulars weitergeleitet wird. "
"Leer lassen, um stattdessen eine Inline-Bestätigung anzuzeigen."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:955
msgid "Redirect After Confirmation"
msgstr "Weiterleitung nach Bestätigung"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:956
msgid ""
"Page to redirect to after a subscriber confirms via the e-mail link. Leave "
"empty to show the built-in confirmation page."
msgstr ""
"Seite, zu der nach der Bestätigung über den E-Mail-Link weitergeleitet wird."
" Leer lassen, um die eingebaute Bestätigungsseite anzuzeigen."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:966
msgid "Redirect After Unsubscribing"
msgstr "Weiterleitung nach Abmeldung"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:967
msgid ""
"Page to redirect to after a subscriber unsubscribes via the e-mail link. "
"Leave empty to show the built-in confirmation page."
msgstr ""
"Seite, zu der nach der Abmeldung über den E-Mail-Link weitergeleitet wird. "
"Leer lassen, um die eingebaute Bestätigungsseite anzuzeigen."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:977
msgid "Recipe Rating Page"
msgstr "Rezept-Bewertungsseite"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:978
msgid ""
"Page that contains the [mmm_recipe_rating_form] shortcode. The \"rate this "
"recipe\" links in the e-mails point here. Leave empty to omit those links."
msgstr ""
"Seite mit dem Shortcode [mmm_recipe_rating_form]. Die „Rezept "
"bewerten“-Links in den E-Mails verweisen hierher. Leer lassen, um diese "
"Links wegzulassen."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:988
msgid "Photo Upload Page"
msgstr "Foto-Upload-Seite"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:989
msgid ""
"Page that contains the [mmm_photo_upload_form] shortcode. The \"upload your "
"photo\" links in the e-mails and the gallery upload button point here. Leave"
" empty to omit those links."
msgstr ""
"Seite mit dem Shortcode [mmm_photo_upload_form]. Die „Foto hochladen“-Links "
"in den E-Mails und der Upload-Button der Galerie führen hierhin. Leer "
"lassen, um diese Links wegzulassen."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1000
msgid "E-Mail Content"
msgstr "E-Mail-Inhalt"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1004
msgid "E-Mail Footer"
msgstr "E-Mail-Fußzeile"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1005
msgid ""
"Footer added to e-mails (e.g. imprint, data controller, opt-out note). HTML "
"allowed."
msgstr ""
"Fußzeile, die an E-Mails angehängt wird (z. B. Impressum, Verantwortlicher, "
"Abmeldehinweis). HTML erlaubt.Fußzeile, die an E-Mails angehängt wird (z. B."
" Impressum, Verantwortlicher, Abmeldehinweis). HTML erlaubt."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1016
msgid "Appended Text Block"
msgstr "Angehängter Textblock"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1017
msgid ""
"HTML or plain text. Each sending rule whose “Append” box is ticked adds this"
" block to the end of its e-mail."
msgstr ""
"HTML oder Klartext. Jede Versandregel mit gesetztem „Anhängen“-Kästchen "
"hängt diesen Block ans Ende ihrer E-Mail an."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1025
msgid "Privacy & retention"
msgstr "Datenschutz & Aufbewahrung"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1029
msgid "Suppression List"
msgstr "Sperrliste"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1030
msgid ""
"Opted-out addresses, one per line. These never receive non-transactional "
"e-mails."
msgstr ""
"Abgemeldete Adressen, eine pro Zeile. Diese erhalten keine nicht-"
"transaktionalen E-Mails.Abgemeldete Adressen, eine pro Zeile. Diese erhalten"
" keine nicht-transaktionalen E-Mails."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1041
msgid "Send Log"
msgstr "Sendeprotokoll"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1042
msgid ""
"Keep a log of sent e-mails (recipient, subject, status — no message "
"content)."
msgstr ""
"Ein Protokoll versendeter E-Mails führen (Empfänger, Betreff, Status – keine"
" Inhalte).Ein Protokoll versendeter E-Mails führen (Empfänger, Betreff, "
"Status – keine Inhalte)."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1053
msgid "Confirmation Window (hours)"
msgstr "Bestätigungsfenster (Stunden)"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1054
msgid "Unconfirmed subscriptions are deleted after this many hours."
msgstr "Unbestätigte Abos werden nach so vielen Stunden gelöscht."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1062
msgid "Retention (days)"
msgstr "Aufbewahrung (Tage)"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1063
msgid "Completed/unsubscribed records are deleted after this many days."
msgstr ""
"Abgeschlossene/abgemeldete Einträge werden nach so vielen Tagen gelöscht."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1071
msgid "Store Consent IP"
msgstr "Einwilligungs-IP speichern"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1072
msgid "Also store the IP address as part of the consent record (optional)."
msgstr ""
"Zusätzlich die IP-Adresse als Teil des Einwilligungsnachweises speichern "
"(optional)."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1090
msgid "Privacy Policy"
msgstr "Datenschutzerklärung"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1091
msgid ""
"A suggestion for the MixMyMeals section of your privacy policy, generated "
"from the settings in the other tabs. It changes by itself when they do — "
"check your published policy after changing a retention period or switching a"
" feature on or off."
msgstr ""
"Ein Vorschlag für den MixMyMeals-Abschnitt deiner Datenschutzerklärung, "
"erzeugt aus den Einstellungen der anderen Reiter. Er ändert sich mit, wenn "
"sie sich ändern — prüfe deine veröffentlichte Erklärung, nachdem du eine "
"Frist geändert oder eine Funktion ein- oder ausgeschaltet hast."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1095
msgid "WordPress emoji"
msgstr "WordPress-Emojis"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1096
msgid ""
"Do not load WordPress's emoji script and emoji images from s.w.org "
"(WordPress Foundation, USA). Browsers show emoji themselves; switched off, "
"the site makes no request to a third party for them and the privacy policy "
"needs no section on it."
msgstr ""
"Das Emoji-Skript und die Emoji-Grafiken von WordPress nicht von s.w.org "
"(WordPress Foundation, USA) laden. Browser stellen Emojis selbst dar; "
"abgeschaltet stellt die Website dafür keine Anfrage an Dritte, und die "
"Datenschutzerklärung braucht dazu keinen Abschnitt."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1144
msgid "Chips"
msgstr "Chips"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1145
msgid ""
"The small labels on recipes, meals, plans and archive cards. Leave a field "
"empty for the wording of the site language. Placeholders in curly braces are"
" filled in; a pattern that drops the value the chip exists to state is "
"ignored."
msgstr ""
"Die kleinen Etiketten an Rezepten, Mahlzeiten, Plänen und Archivkarten. Ein "
"leeres Feld nimmt den Wortlaut der Seitensprache. Platzhalter in "
"geschweiften Klammern werden ersetzt; ein Muster, das den Wert weglässt, den"
" der Chip nennen soll, wird ignoriert."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1181
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Sprache"

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1182
msgid ""
"How the site words things. Each text here replaces the wording that comes "
"with the site language."
msgstr ""
"Wie die Seite Dinge formuliert. Jeder Text hier ersetzt den Wortlaut, den "
"die Seitensprache mitbringt."

#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1233
#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1406
#: includes/class-mixmymeals-settings.php:1554
